Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.23,1:19:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But nowadays, no, it's just a marketing name.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.11,1:19:57.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is not recorded.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.49,1:20:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want my customers to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.35,1:20:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.31,1:20:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's so cut this part out of the recording, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.83,1:20:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, it is an improvement over the previous generation.
