Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.08,1:20:16.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.54,1:20:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,OK, so I'd like to ask a question about the optimization methods.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.22,1:20:30.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So one of the great challenges in optimization is if you have a great many variables to optimize, it gets really quite hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.86,1:20:36.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now you spoke mostly about the source optimization.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.54,1:20:39.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there's a lot of variables in the source optimization.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.98,1:20:45.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then you also mention the so-called OPC which is the mask optimization.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.50,1:20:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that adds even more variables because in principle the geometric shapes can be represented by an infinite number of variables.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.78,1:20:55.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you have a very huge number of variables.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.26,1:21:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So shouldn't you be doing the optimization of all of them together rather than saying, I'm going to do source optimization.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.88,1:21:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should be saying, I'm going to do the optimization of everything the source, the mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.50,1:21:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I do it all in one big optimization.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.50,1:21:12.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah so let me first answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.82,1:21:13.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.90,1:21:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And perhaps I wasn't completely clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.28,1:21:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember that video where we picked some clips out of this huge design.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.06,1:21:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those clips were supposed to be representative proxies for the incredible variety of patterns of the whole design.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.24,1:21:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,When we optimize the illumination, we optimize that with the OPC for those clips.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.28,1:21:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we but we cannot say, let's optimize the whole design with hundreds of billions of patterns,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.48,1:21:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,together with all these variables in the illumination and with all of the variables in the projection optics.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's simply computationally is not yet feasible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.56,1:22:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what we do is we take some of these clips.
