Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.90,1:22:12.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize then we say, now this illumination, probably since it is good for the most critical patterns, will be good for all of the other patterns.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.13,1:22:15.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we do the OPC, a divide and conquer strategy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.45,1:22:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the OPC stage, you don't change the design anymore.
